# T2c round 2: the same mono-part rule on LIVE's PLAY layer. Two BASS keys held, the first
# released: BASS keeps sounding (voices 1). When the last key is released it stops (voices 0).
wait 300
press PLAY
wait 700
release PLAY
expect mode 1
tap SEL
expect layer 1
events legato_live_events.txt
key 0 down
wait 100
key 2 down
wait 100
key 0 up
wait 3000
expect voices 1
key 2 up
wait 3000
expect voices 0
eventsstop
